CORRECTION (Oct 22, ~18:40 MDT, per review recheck + Treasury methodology page
https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/TextView?type=daily):
these daily par yields are INTERPOLATED ESTIMATES derived from indicative,
bid-side market price quotations (not actual transactions) obtained by the
Federal Reserve Bank of New York at or near 3:30 PM each trading day. They are
NOT exchange settlements. The plotted value is labeled "US Treasury daily par
yield" in the chart caption, tooltip, and data note. The 4.96 value and the
20-close streak check are unaffected.
